        "unit": "trading_day",
        "expected_interval": 1,
        "warn_multiple": 1,
        "critical_multiple": 3,
        "label": "每交易日"
      },
      "coverage": {
        "count": {
          "kind": "meta_distinct",
          "path": "meta/daily_index.parquet",
          "filter": {"column": "data_type", "value": "index"},
          "column": "ts_code"
        }
      },
      "note": "指数没有稳定的「应有标的数」分母，只报覆盖数量，不计算占比。"
    },
